{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111915","id":2936957657,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vDmrZ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111915","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111915.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111915.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111915","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111915/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111915/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111915/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aad270b5b02c5b95b7c5b16b8a8248729caef16c","number":111915,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix sub_emitter does not process during `request_particles_process`","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111885*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nThis issue caused by processing order.  When we config a `sub_emitter`, we want the `sub_emitter` will process just after every parent step.\r\n\r\nBut when we use `request_particles_process` to skip a short of time, `ParticlesStorage` process first parent before sub_emitter. That means if we want to delay 1 second before render particles, `ParticlesStorage` first let parent particles process 1 seconds, then handle the sub_emitter, so sub_emitter always start from parent particles ended. The sub_emitter can only be emitted from the parent's last position of `request_particles_process` time.\r\n\r\n- fixed_fps: 30 (30 frame per seconds)\r\n- request_particles_process(1.0) (process particles 1 second before start)\r\n- first, let parent particles process 30 frames\r\n- second, let sub_emitter particles process 30 frames.\r\n\r\nWhat we want is processing parent and sub_emitter one by one during the `request_particles_process` time.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAfter the '_particles_process' is executed, if there is a `sub_emtter`, it will continue to execute the `sub_emitter` and save it in the `processed_particles`. If it is found that the particles have already been processed, it will jump out to avoid duplicate processing.\r\n\r\n[particles.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/717dbe02-23a2-416d-b847-79009e5d501d)\r\n\r\n## Etc\r\n\r\nI am not sure the `processed_particles.has(particles->particle_buffer)` is suitable for `HashSet` matching. Any advice?\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":nul